version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6262366Z   IOS en-US Beschreibung zeichen=1493: Say it in one sentence – Loose Ends takes care of the rest.
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6262742Z 
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6263517Z Tasks show up on the go: on a walk, at the checkout, while reading an email. Loose Ends captures them in a single sentence, without a form to fill in. The app then works out what is in your sentence and later shows you just what fits your situation right now.
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6264384Z 
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6264485Z CAPTURE IN ONE SENTENCE
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6264961Z • Type or dictate – in the app, on Apple Watch, with widgets, the Action button and Shortcuts
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6265732Z • Share sheet: turn text, links, emails, photos and files straight into a task
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6266247Z • Your original sentence is always kept unchanged
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6266487Z 
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6266592Z THE APP SORTS IT FOR YOU
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6267031Z • Due date, duration, importance and context are recognized from your sentence
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6267709Z • Fixed rules first, Apple Intelligence on your device only where language understanding is needed
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6268348Z • Learns from your choices: tag a sentence once, and it knows next time
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6268647Z 
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6268746Z YOU HAVE THE LAST WORD
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6269041Z • Every change is visible on the task
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6269374Z • Every field can be reset on its own
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6269564Z 
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6269668Z VIEWS THAT FIT THE MOMENT
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6270008Z • Now, New, Due, Quick, Old, Waiting, Parked, Completed
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6270584Z • By tag ("Garden", "Computer") and by project
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6270947Z • Repeating tasks and subtasks
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6271121Z 
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6271283Z REMINDS YOU AT THE RIGHT TIME – AND PLACE
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6271710Z • Notification on the due day with Complete, Next up, Tomorrow
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6272148Z • Reminder on arriving at a place (iPhone, iPad)
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6272518Z • Optionally add dates to your calendar
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6272718Z 
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6272819Z EVERYWHERE YOU ARE
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:31:31.6273100Z • iPhone, iPad, Mac and Apple Watch
